2026-07-27T12:04:07.9728910Z i /tmp/RtmpXg41kY/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:04:07.9729292Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:04:07.9729746Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:04:07.9730141Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:04:07.9730762Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:04:07.9731700Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:04:07.9732720Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
